---
title: Browse Artifact List
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant CP as Content Panel
    participant HTTP as Artifact Client
    participant API as Artifact API (Server)

    Dev->>CP: Opens content panel / refreshes
    CP->>HTTP: listArtifacts()
    HTTP->>API: GET /artifacts
    API-->>HTTP: ArtifactEntry[] (path, type, size)
    HTTP-->>CP: ArtifactEntry[]
    CP->>Dev: Render artifact list grouped by directory
